 Get an item.
 
+#### .getOrInsertComputed(key, factory)
+
+Get an item, or synchronously compute and insert it when the item is missing or expired. The `factory` is called with `key` and its return value is stored using the cache's default `maxAge`. On a cache hit, the factory is not called and recency is refreshed as with `.get()`.
+
 #### .has(key)
 
 Check if an item exists.
